      "aiGuidance": {
        "extraction": "One or two plain sentences drawn from the record's own content.",
        "negativeGuidance": "Do not restate the title or add claims the source does not make.",
        "purpose": "A short orientation for a reader who will not open the record: what this is and why it matters."
